# Companies House API exploration — Phase 1 reconnaissance.
# Requires the REST Client extension (humao.rest-client) and a
# COMPANIES_HOUSE_API_KEY entry in .env at the repo root.
# Auth is HTTP Basic with the key as username and an empty password —
# the trailing colon on the Authorization line is required.

@chKey = {{$dotenv COMPANIES_HOUSE_API_KEY}}

### Smoke test — should return 200 and JSON
GET https://api.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/00000006
Authorization: Basic {{chKey}}:

# example comapany number for testing: BARCLAYS BANK PLC
@companyNumber = 01026167

### Company profile
GET https://api.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/{{companyNumber}}
Authorization: Basic {{chKey}}:

### PSC — control-based ownership
GET https://api.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/{{companyNumber}}/persons-with-significant-control
Authorization: Basic {{chKey}}:

### Filing history, accounts only
GET https://api.company-information.service.gov.uk/company/{{companyNumber}}/filing-history?category=accounts
Authorization: Basic {{chKey}}:

### Document metadata
@documentId = B0GjhuJYdKRbZa4jJbfP_D5B8VmM2xKqmIgVW4bnHcM
GET https://document-api.company-information.service.gov.uk/document/{{documentId}}
Authorization: Basic {{chKey}}:

### Document content — stop at the 302
# @no-redirect
GET https://document-api.company-information.service.gov.uk/document/{{documentId}}/content
Authorization: Basic {{chKey}}:
Accept: application/pdf
